# Overview
---
QXA is the WISDOM found between the QUESTION and the ANSWER. 
IO is the sense that all things move IN and OUT.

QXA IO is a re-establishment of the pocket internet, also known as the _rabbit hole machine_. At its core, QXA IO is a framework for the rapid production and management of information surfaces with widescale flexibility, interchangeability, and clarity of providence and ownership at all layers.

Powered by a YAML-adjacent data storage system, each surface of the platform is decoupled from its data in a way which allows universal storage storage without removing the local area awareness of the materials produced and available in the location.

Never lose your things again! That is the X between the Q and the A. The crossroads between the who and the what.

# Concept Space
---
QXA IO is a new internet platform that blends the best aspects of social media, old web services like Angelfire and Geocities, and creative production and sharing of creations of many kinds. 

The core space is a thin browser application launched by the user from their local installation. Similar to a browser, this core architecture will set up the local installation of the launch core and storage of local spaces developed by the user. 

Additionally, an online public store and address system will be available, allowing users to search for various toys, tools and decorations they may download to use on their locally installed surfaces. The online space will include public surfaces for community connection and group building, as well as privately run instances of users' local rooms, when the user would like to offer those to be visited by others.




